per_rank_text:
Heals your Tamed Pet for health over 15 sec.

@ext:This ability is usable while shapeshifted.:ext@

@ext:Tamed Pet includes Summoned Demon, Enslave Demon, Dominate Undead, Tame Dragonkin, Tether Elemental, Summoned Ghoul, and Tame Beast.:ext@

Increases the target's chance to critically hit with spells by 3%. 

When the target critically hits the caster's chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 3% for 10 sec. 

@ext:Cannot be cast on self.:ext@

Creates a Minor Healthstone that can be used to instantly restore 100 health.

Conjured items disappear if logged out for more than 15 minutes.

@ext:This ability is usable while shapeshifted.:ext@

Increases your magic damage and your pets' damage by 15%. Lasts 6 sec, increased by 3 sec for each target afflicted by your Corruption, Curse of Agony, Immolate, Shadow Word: Pain and Devouring Plague, up to a maximum of 24 sec.

@ext:Does not stack with other similar effects.:ext@

@ext:This ability is usable while shapeshifted.:ext@

Summons a Wrath of Air Totem with 5 health at the feet of the caster. The totem provides 5% spell haste to all party and raid members within 50 yards. Lasts 5 min.

@ext:Does not stack with other similar effects.:ext@

@ext:This ability is usable while shapeshifted.:ext@

Summons a Mana Spring Totem with 5 health at the feet of the caster for 5 min that restores 16 mana every 5 seconds to all party and raid members within 30 yards.

@ext:Does not stack with other similar effects.:ext@

@ext:This ability is usable while shapeshifted.:ext@

Summons a Strength of Earth Totem with 5 health at the feet of the caster. The totem increases the Strength and Agility of all party and raid members within 50 yards by 8. Lasts 5 min.

@ext:Does not stack with other similar effects.:ext@

@ext:This ability is usable while shapeshifted.:ext@

Reduces all damage taken by 50% for 12 sec.

Cannot be used within 30 sec of using Avenging Wrath.

@ext:This ability is usable while shapeshifted.:ext@

Summon a herd of stampeding animals from the wilds around you that deal Physical damage to your enemies over 6 sec. The animals run up to 30 yards in front of you.

Enemies struck by the stampede take increased damage from your pet by 5% for 15 sec. Stacks up to 4 times. Enemies struck also have their movement speed reduced by 50% for 3 sec.

@ext:Damage is increased by 50% if Bestial Wrath is active on your pet.:ext@

@ext:The cooldown of Stampede is reduced by the Longevity talent.:ext@

